Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:21.99,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\an4\fad(2500,2000)\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\be1\b0\fs21\c&HEFEFEF&\pos(278,308)}"To make a prairie\Nit takes a clover and one bee"\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h— Emily Dickinson
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I love cherry blossoms.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:34.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But for some reason,\NI feel relieved when they've fallen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:43.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just joking...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:55.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Takemoto-kun's strange, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:57.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Like his shorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:00:58.77,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's like, too healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:02.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's not unhealthy enough.\NHardly the art school type.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:05.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's got zero fashion sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:06.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This enough chives?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, but that also\nmakes him appealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:11.43,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Not as a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Bet he's nice to girlfriends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Bet he's single.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:15.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,- No girlfriend.\N- Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:24.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put milk in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:40.44,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\3c&H635514&}I dreamed about a "Kazemachi Dori"\nrice omelet last night{\be1\3c&H000000&} — From Morita
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:43.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:45.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he's getting back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's his deal, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:53.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,To me, he's just\nan annoying 8th year student.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:08.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:12.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll start the grill!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:22.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's time for the Hanamoto Lab\NJunior Group Retreat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,meaning, a gathering\nof Hanamoto-sensei's fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:28.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:34.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Does everybody have enough beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:36.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, we need more here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:42.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Beer? There's another dozen\nin the studio refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:44.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The second floor's such a mess,\nit's hard to find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:36.17,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}For the first time,\NI saw someone fall in love.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:43.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thing is, there's\nsome girl in the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:48.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.\NI totally forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:05.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um... that's my cousin's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:10.03,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hanamoto Hagumi,\nwho joined my oil painting class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:13.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,She's also staying here.\NLook after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:17.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I know you hardly saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada, your spine's crooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:40.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll never forget...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:45.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}this day, and everything this day\nput into motion.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:15.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I understand, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:19.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you came by, Takemoto.\NI've got to go see Koda-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:24.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is Hanamoto Hagu,\nmy cousin's daughter, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How much do I owe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,She can't eat out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:34.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So will you take my place?\NI know it's a weird request.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:36.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And this is Takemoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:39.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Takemoto's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.49,0:06:43.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's the least arty student\nat our school, a real find...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:44.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,All you have to do is just sit there.\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:48.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,She's in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:40.01,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0C1212&\3c&H5B685E&\shad0\bord1\frx12\fry22\pos(405,239)\frz350.912}Hanamoto Lab
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:39.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This whole warehouse, alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:15.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, did you paint this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:16.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:18.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Did you paint this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:19.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I just got totally ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:24.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is good, really good!\NWhat's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:30.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:32.97,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:38.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:42.87,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Your name's Hagu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu's a really weird name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:47.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:50.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hagu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Your painting's good, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:55.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Almost as good as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:17.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.48,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:27.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Takemoto,\nyour dorm neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:36.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san, when did you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:40.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What? I thought you already\ngraduated, Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:43.97,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What! I thought you'd died,\NMorita-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:47.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you disappeared\non Mt. Chomolungma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:05.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I never heard you praise\nanyone's work before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:10.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes it is, that was a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:11.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:16.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think Picasso and Basquiat\naren't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.24,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I have this sick feeling\nyou're serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:24.01,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'm serious.\NI believe in recognizing talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:34.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,All right, ready?\NIt can be a smell or a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:39.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Not just your friend's face,\nsitting next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:42.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Close your eyes, move closer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:45.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,and make a picture of what you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:46.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How do you write your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Like it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:44.38,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:50.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Takemoto,\NI live next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:54.83,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.24,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Takemoto-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:04.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:06.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,it's like bursting with energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:12.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And is this right side up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:22.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're so easy to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:28.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No one's ever said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:31.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:47.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Kids are so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:13:00.66,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If they want to, they can draw\nsmells and voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.87,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,We'll never be able to recapture\nsuch invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:09.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe some rare people can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:20.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just joking...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:28.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:33.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Draw crazier paintings,\ncrazier than hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:39.49,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\b0\fs18\fsp-2\pos(401,279)\c&H0C140D&\frz1.051}Takemoto
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:33.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He really is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:35.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's amazing is the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:44.23,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Flesh, blood, bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:47.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,earth and insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:51.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,they're all the real thing.\NYou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:54.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:58.21,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,When I don't know\nwhat I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:05.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:16.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,A souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just a leftover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:24.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:29.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's the crap that sells,\nall over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:34.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Such an impure heart\nmaking something so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:39.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But I made it, so in 10 years\nit'll be worth a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:44.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Use it to send your kids\nto private school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:51.20,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ten years from now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:53.77,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder what I'll be doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:57.44,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If he's going\nto paint all his life...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:08.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's this? Doraemon's\nvoice-over actress changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:13.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?\NThat actress changed before you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:15.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:22.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:25.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:33.57,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you going to ask,\N"You were alive? Where were you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Be more interested in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:38.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No souvenirs for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:12.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's against the law\nto stalk people, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:20.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You may want her, but love means\nshe has to want you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:21.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:26.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I told a female cop she was cute
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,and got charged with\nsexual harassment, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:32.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:35.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why's that all you get!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:37.97,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:41.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How old is that lady?\NA lot older than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Have a normal, fun love-life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:48.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:53.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If I keep this up,\NI really will get arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.96,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\fs20\b0\pos(390,125)\frx8\fry354\frz5.383\c&H1D1B18&}Rika-san's lip cream
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:59.13,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\fs18\b0\fsp-1\frz3.5\c&H110C0E&\frx8\fry0\pos(537,72)}Rika-san's favorite perfume
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:01.30,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\fs18\b0\fsp-1\c&H110C0E&\frz6.883\pos(523,90)\frx20\fry348}Notepaper Rika-san used
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.46,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\fs18\b0\fsp-1\frx20\fry348\frz1.2\pos(457,104)\c&H070506&}A straw Rika-san used
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:13.85,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!\NAll you bumpkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:15.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:19.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm grateful to be welcomed\nhome from my long travels
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,with such a modest party.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:26.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I really am grateful, but...\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.53,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:44.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:47.01,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:52.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't have anyone\nto eat lunch with,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,that is, if Hanamoto-sensei can't\nmake it to lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:59.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,would you consider\nhaving lunch with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:08.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Really? See you at lunch\nin the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:11.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll save us seats.\NSee you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:17.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What, what, what?\NYou don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:31.59,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,See the bulletin board?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:20:01.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It says, " Mayama, a senior\nin Architecture City Design
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:04.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,is late submitting\nhis senior thesis".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:09.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly, I just can't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:13.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Having to condense\N4 years of education...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:18.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why not postpone\ngraduating a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:22.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:25.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Postpone it a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.65,0:20:35.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I'm hungry.\NWant to get a bite to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.33,0:20:42.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What? Eat something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:43.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:46.75,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.97,0:20:51.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:56.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bit of a walk but\nhow about Mediterranean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:21:00.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's 11AM, they're probably\nopen for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:03.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Or someplace closer by...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:08.48,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:14.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right now?\NSure, within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:17.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right there.\NSorry, gotta work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:22.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I need more work\nif I'm staying behind a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:31.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's not good.\NMore work is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.96,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After finishing working at\nthe Harada Design Office,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:54.57,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I begin my surveillance at 1PM\nat the park.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:06.91,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Fifteen minutes later,\NI start tailing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:14.48,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And I follow Mayama.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:12.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What a coincidence, totally.\NMayama-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:14.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:16.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.53,0:23:28.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Rika-san?\NWhat a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.94,0:23:36.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Let me introduce you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:42.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is Harada Rika-san, from\nthe design office where I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:49.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is Yamada-san,\na year behind me in art school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:53.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,From Hanamoto-kun's Lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:56.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, Yamada-san's in ceramics,\nso not the Lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:24:00.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um, she's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.70,0:24:04.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,an acquaintance from\nthe Hanamoto group.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.70,0:24:05.62,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Acquaintance?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:09.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, we all get together\nand drink
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:11.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,at Hanamoto-san's,\nonce in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:13.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's where...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.98,0:24:16.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And Rika-san, I mean, Harada-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.38,0:24:18.26,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rika-san?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.25,0:24:21.13,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Studied architecture\nwith Hanamoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.13,0:24:26.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He introduces me to gifted students\nwho work part-time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:31.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gifted, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:33.09,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Mayama's in love.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.23,0:24:35.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I hardly feel I'm worth paying...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.93,0:24:38.23,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're definitely worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:39.66,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I knew it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:52.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:24:56.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I want to check out a store\nthat way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.85,0:24:59.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.16,0:25:02.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.42,0:25:36.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'd heard about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.47,0:25:48.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're Hanamoto Hagumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.27,0:25:53.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you submit your work\nfor a prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.48,0:25:59.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But there's one condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.73,0:26:18.43,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go buy meal tickets.\NWhat do you want, Hagu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.27,0:26:22.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The Stamina Lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:35.68,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,There's the girl genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:39.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Her? Up close,\nshe's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.32,0:26:40.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Scholarship student.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.42,0:26:44.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Not your average student.\NExplains her slightly suspicious look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.83,0:26:47.53,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The girl genius is up holding\nour school's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.53,0:26:48.83,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Lots of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.96,0:26:50.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,She's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.27,0:26:52.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,She's an "artist".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.71,0:27:04.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's so crowded and noisy,\nlet's go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.05,0:27:08.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I know, have you been\nto "Kazemachi Dori"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:13.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Their rice omelet's perfect.\NJust their rice omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:25.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I see, you're from Nagano.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.17,0:27:30.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Nagano brings to mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.84,0:27:34.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The Matsumoto castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.24,0:27:36.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The castle keep\nis a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.58,0:27:41.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's a five-tiered keep\nso it's really imposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.45,0:27:45.75,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know a five-tiered keep?\NDo you even know a castle keep?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.89,0:27:49.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, do you even know\NMatsumoto castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.16,0:27:54.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's not right, Hagu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.47,0:27:58.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Born in Nagano and you've\nnever seen Matsumoto castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.93,0:28:04.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Castles are great, old buildings are\ngreat, they're what men dream about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.61,0:28:10.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know? In that giant structure,\nthere are no nails...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.61,0:28:11.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Ayu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:17.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What? You know Yamada-san\nfrom Ceramics?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.95,0:28:20.28,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.40,0:28:35.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Bye, I have to go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.31,0:28:45.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If it's all right,\nmaybe we could have lunch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.99,0:28:53.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meow-zaburo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.07,0:29:00.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm here at your call{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:06.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Red scarf, waving in the wind{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.03,0:29:12.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meow-zaburo's here to rescue{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.27,0:29:17.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}a shopping arcade in need of help{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.81,0:29:20.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Meow-zaburo is\nreally into it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.57,0:29:40.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.67,0:29:47.57,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Something bad happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:50.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.81,0:29:53.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No thanks, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.82,0:29:57.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.45,0:30:01.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What if you find\nmy story disgusting...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:07.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.26,0:30:12.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't suit you\nto look so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:20.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Looking miserable suits you,\NYamada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.78,0:30:24.24,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You got me back good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.89,0:30:35.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Harada, it's been 5 years\nsince you vanished,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.42,0:30:38.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}leaving a huge hole\nin Rika's heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.33,0:30:43.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But I can't fill that hole.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.90,0:30:45.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Not me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.24,0:30:57.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.20,0:30:59.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What, you're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.31,0:31:04.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You were out before\nso I'm back to offer a greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.35,0:31:08.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't sound so formal,\NI'm not even your instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.62,0:31:09.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.96,0:31:12.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I teach architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.19,0:31:14.13,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's my major, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.26,0:31:16.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's not architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.93,0:31:17.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.72,0:31:20.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What brought you back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:23.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thought I'd have a solo show,\nto kill some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.11,0:31:26.13,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,There's a gallery\nthat's been after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.27,0:31:29.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Fujiwara Gallery, right?\NThey told me themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.18,0:31:31.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.11,0:31:33.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:35.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Still no plans to graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.62,0:31:39.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so in love\nwith the school and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.65,0:31:44.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,A solo show at that gallery\nto kill time and no plans to finish...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.73,0:31:48.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just about your speed.\NWhy don't you get serious, for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:53.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Are they... That important?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:57.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Those fag brothers are?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.10,0:32:07.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oops, I don't have time for this.\NI've got to go, Morita.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.98,0:32:09.85,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I stick around?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.98,0:32:11.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Feel free.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.42,0:32:12.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:20.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,A souvenir, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.91,0:32:24.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What is this? It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.21,0:32:32.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.47,0:32:35.09,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fix dinner, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.02,0:32:46.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,We're having pasta tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.00,0:32:55.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Today, Koda-sensei said
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.56,0:33:00.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I should apply to the Oslo\NInternational something or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.77,0:33:02.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The Biennale.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.90,0:33:05.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.71,0:33:12.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds good, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:18.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But not my usual paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.35,0:33:23.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right, I guess she means no abstracts.\NI've heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:25.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,They're bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.99,0:33:28.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Abstracts aren't hot now.\NThey're not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.03,0:33:35.53,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You should paint the pictures\nyou want, however you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.10,0:33:38.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter if\nyou win a prize or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.38,0:33:49.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If you like it, you keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.21,0:33:56.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.80,0:35:18.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,There she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.97,0:37:34.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.74,0:37:36.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to call you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.01,0:37:40.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to Morita's show?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:43.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'd like to go to the opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:47.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Is this already finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.92,0:37:51.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, probably not.\NShe hasn't signed it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.59,0:37:56.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going, could you take\NHagu with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.00,0:37:59.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What? Aren't you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.63,0:38:02.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going but I've got to\nstop off somewhere first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.44,0:38:07.57,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, I'm happy to...\NAs long as Hagu-chan doesn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.71,0:38:12.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada said she's attending\nthe opening, so take her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.63,0:38:14.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.92,0:38:20.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Might as well invite Mayama\nand have him drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.29,0:38:25.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What do you say we pick her up\nat home about 1PM?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:30.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,First, I have to see\nhow Hagu-chan feels about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.90,0:38:35.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So, where's Hagu-chan today?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.47,0:38:37.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well, she's taking\nan awful long break.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.46,0:39:00.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I like that painting of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.36,0:39:07.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Your sculpture was better\na week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.41,0:39:18.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Busted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.38,0:39:23.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, I screwed it up.\NI have to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.22,0:39:30.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Once you carve,\nyou can't fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.03,0:39:35.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Wood sculpture's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.23,0:39:39.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I can understand\nwhy it's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.97,0:39:42.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But it looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.43,0:39:47.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.08,0:41:32.27,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The world I could never see,\nno matter how I strained,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.91,0:41:35.84,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}unrealized dreams\nand longings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.42,0:41:41.51,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder how the world looks,\nseen through their eyes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.50,0:41:53.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, it's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.43,0:41:56.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's really lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.80,0:41:58.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.67,0:42:00.23,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.01,0:42:02.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's curved.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.88,0:42:06.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine isn't it, Luigi?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.51,0:42:09.95,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's more than fine, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.22,0:42:15.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Do you get it, Morita-kun?\NThis isn't about having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.49,0:42:18.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right, this is business.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.23,0:42:22.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right, unfortunately,\nbefore it's art...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.13,0:42:26.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, unfortunately,\nit's a product first.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.80,0:42:28.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.71,0:42:34.48,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.28,0:42:39.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just have a normal, fun,\nyouthful love affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.35,0:42:45.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I bet girls like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.15,0:42:47.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If you just go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.03,0:42:58.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Takemoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.00,0:43:01.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,We're having a barbecue upstairs,\njoin us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.04,0:43:03.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.84,0:43:06.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, hey.\NDid something bad happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.94,0:43:09.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.31,0:43:15.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Come eat.\NHonestly, it's beef, real beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.75,0:43:20.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Real beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.99,0:43:28.19,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.73,0:43:30.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Tastes awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.27,0:43:35.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.94,0:43:39.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,About this meat, you know\nthe shopping arcade where I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.07,0:43:44.53,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The young boss at Suzuki Butcher's,\neven though the young boss is over 40,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:46.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,he'd been set up on a date,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.98,0:43:51.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,and he was all for it and\nwanted to date her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.99,0:43:53.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's that paint smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.25,0:43:55.85,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it was meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.29,0:44:01.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's not right, Morita-san.\NThe delicate aroma of this meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.76,0:44:02.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.03,0:44:04.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.17,0:44:08.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sure I will, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.01,0:44:19.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meat, I like meat{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.87,0:44:24.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meat, I just love meat{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.60,0:45:15.13,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'd had a bad feeling all day,\nthat day{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.18,0:46:04.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.47,0:46:25.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.74,0:46:28.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Because you ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.48,0:46:31.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm running\nbecause you're chasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.45,0:46:34.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.85,0:46:40.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.02,0:46:45.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.83,0:46:47.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.11,0:46:51.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.70,0:46:56.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.04,0:46:58.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.77,0:47:03.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.44,0:47:06.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt I'll change.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.98,0:47:13.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um, it'll be much easier\nif you find another guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.79,0:47:21.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think you'd better stop\nlooking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.28,0:47:46.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Was I dumped?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.47,0:48:06.17,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hurt Yamada.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.37,0:48:08.81,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After which...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.31,0:48:11.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.72,0:48:17.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, I'm fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.25,0:48:19.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,To put it bluntly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.25,0:48:23.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Because I love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.12,0:48:26.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Forgive me\nif I've misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.12,0:48:27.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.16,0:48:30.75,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.13,0:48:34.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This office is too small\nfor that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.30,0:48:38.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.\NI think you're absolutely correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.64,0:48:42.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.51,0:48:45.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Um, is that the only reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.05,0:48:48.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.88,0:48:54.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Your work was better than\nany of my other workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.19,0:48:58.95,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm relieved to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.33,0:49:02.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll think up a new approach\nand come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.26,0:49:03.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Good bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.06,0:49:06.86,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After which,\NI got dumped.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.00,0:49:08.63,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Getting dumped,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.84,0:49:12.50,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}the feelings only grew stronger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.67,0:49:16.09,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm talking about Yamada, here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.55,0:49:49.68,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.15,0:49:52.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu-chan, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.23,0:49:59.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.58,0:50:20.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you start working\non such a large scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.32,0:50:23.75,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Honey, that's a wonderful question.\NDo you mind if I answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.89,0:50:27.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to the size of his talent,\nthis is nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.82,0:50:29.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't even relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.56,0:50:31.09,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's heading off into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.46,0:50:35.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is what it means\nto live by your art.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.63,0:50:38.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san's like a celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.14,0:50:43.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He feels so far away...\NIs that a tuxedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.67,0:50:46.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen someone\nwearing a tuxedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.78,0:50:50.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And he even looks good in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.51,0:51:17.09,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArtificeSSK\fscx60\b0\fsp3\bord0\shad0\fs24\c&H050A09&\frz354.581\pos(254,205)\frx24\fry2}Hole-Ridden Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.51,0:51:17.09,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b0\fsp2\bord0\shad0\fs16\c&H1F3D82&\frz2.908\pos(445,270)}Sold
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.16,0:51:33.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.49,0:51:38.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I decided not to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.63,0:51:45.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This show needed\na giant piece of art to anchor it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.10,0:51:49.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have time to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.98,0:51:56.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The price is so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.32,0:52:03.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,We make the art,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.79,0:52:07.66,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,and the gallery puts a price on it.\NThat's how this world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.12,0:52:10.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So I've done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.73,0:52:14.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.74,0:52:24.21,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You don't agree, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.86,0:52:44.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.68,0:52:59.87,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Rika-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.48,0:53:01.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.44,0:53:05.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Hanamoto, darling.\NYou've made my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.72,0:53:08.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.52,0:53:15.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's been way too long, way too\nmeaningful, we're way too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.40,0:53:19.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.70,0:53:21.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rika-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.90,0:53:28.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama-kun, these are the Fujiwara brothers.\NThey own the gallery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.14,0:53:32.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,They were art school classmates\nwith Hanamoto-kun and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.21,0:53:35.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Despite their looks,\nthey've got great taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.08,0:53:37.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Is this show Morita-kun's?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.58,0:53:40.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's been discovered\nby some real operators.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.88,0:53:41.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.09,0:53:45.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hana darling,\nyou finally caught Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.16,0:53:49.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do I have to\ntell you, it's never been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.33,0:53:51.66,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How can you say that, Hana darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.80,0:53:55.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time\nyou forgot about Harada-kun, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.73,0:53:59.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hanamoto-kun and I aren't involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.85,0:54:18.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.99,0:54:21.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he did, he hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.06,0:54:27.19,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Everything OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.46,0:54:28.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.43,0:54:32.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's that art critic...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.30,0:54:34.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,We used to be like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.81,0:54:38.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.28,0:54:45.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.73,0:54:59.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.61,0:55:03.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.83,0:55:05.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That pretentious guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.44,0:55:07.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's Nagata Kei,\nthe art critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.64,0:55:10.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He called the sculpture...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.51,0:55:12.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Did he badmouth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.88,0:55:15.57,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He said, "It's only big".
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.68,0:55:18.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.42,0:55:21.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, for that she jumped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.58,0:55:24.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What? Hagu-chan did...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.12,0:55:29.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, and I was trying to stop her...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.71,0:55:54.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,This is the legendary car.\NI've only heard stories about!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.22,0:55:55.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.89,0:56:00.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It took me a year of fixing it up\nto get it into driving shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.39,0:56:03.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.03,0:56:08.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.03,0:56:10.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.50,0:56:12.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.68,0:56:13.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.87,0:56:15.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.04,0:56:17.20,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.74,0:56:23.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!\NI want to go to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.48,0:56:24.57,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.71,0:56:26.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, c'mon, Hagu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.08,0:56:28.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.35,0:56:30.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.83,0:56:35.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.63,0:56:36.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.39,0:56:37.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, c'mon, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.19,0:56:41.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, please don't drive,\NMorita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.53,0:56:44.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll drive, you don't have to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.40,0:56:48.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.25,0:56:59.77,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san! Morita-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.70,0:57:15.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, Morita-san,\neasy on the gas pedal there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.30,0:57:22.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Great, great, I love this\nworn-out engine, I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.34,0:57:23.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.47,0:57:25.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Ease up on the gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.51,0:57:26.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Worn-out?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:31.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think it may smell smoky.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.72,0:57:40.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hagu-chan, you're from Nagano?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.99,0:57:44.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I always wanted to ask\nsomeone from Nagano.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.26,0:57:48.06,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Is it true that 40 percent\nof people
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.20,0:57:50.83,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,from Nagano\nhaven't seen the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.74,0:57:57.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Forty percent sounds too high...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.48,0:58:00.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Takemoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.64,0:58:03.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.47,0:58:25.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.34,0:59:09.83,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.06,1:00:02.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll scream, Takemoto.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.70,1:00:05.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds good, Morita-san.\NYou're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.64,1:00:10.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the best!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.88,1:00:14.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Youth is best!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.11,1:00:21.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,When you say the word youth,\nit's so totally earnest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.73,1:00:31.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.13,1:00:35.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,A photo of youth\nto look back on in old age.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.23,1:00:39.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The height of youthful folly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.64,1:01:15.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.34,1:01:20.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Shit, it's your fault for not\nreally fixing it, Mayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:23.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one that\nraced it too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.95,1:01:25.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What, it's my fault?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.92,1:01:29.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What are you kicking?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.22,1:01:32.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.62,1:01:35.25,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh, thank god\nyou're with them, Yamada.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.39,1:01:38.63,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Please look after Hagu.\NYou're my only hope, Yamada.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.93,1:01:43.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me... she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.57,1:01:46.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You sound too scary,\nSensei.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:51.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama's boasting it'll be\nan easy fix in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.84,1:01:54.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,OK, then.\nGood night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.15,1:01:57.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.45,1:01:59.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada, got 100 yen?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.65,1:02:05.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think you should stop, Morita-san.\NYou've already spent 2,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.76,1:02:10.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't learn how to lose now,\nyour life will be a series of tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.83,1:02:18.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my, you're awfully insightful,\naren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.91,1:02:28.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I was the only fool in love...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.42,1:02:38.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Did you already tell Hagu-chan\nhow you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.92,1:02:43.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You get right to the point,\ndon't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.43,1:02:47.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.96,1:02:51.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.70,1:02:59.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Better get it together or\nyou'll regret it the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.08,1:03:02.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I mean both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.78,1:03:04.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The rest of my life...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.78,1:03:09.01,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.73,1:03:25.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The person I love
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.27,1:03:29.24,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,chooses to love me\nabove all others.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.11,1:03:33.77,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's all it takes,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.81,1:03:37.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,but I don't think\nit'll ever happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.98,1:03:41.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You kids think too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.95,1:03:44.68,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Giving up...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.39,1:03:48.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.79,1:03:51.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.50,1:03:57.13,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That was a really good line.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.14,1:04:01.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I can really do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.84,1:04:04.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Refuse to give up?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.47,1:04:07.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're really in love...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.72,1:04:14.83,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.35,1:04:18.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,you get me, like nobody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.92,1:04:22.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I get you like nobody else does.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.49,1:04:25.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.40,1:04:32.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,we're the best team\nfor getting each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.30,1:04:36.97,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Like peaches and cream.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.11,1:04:41.77,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Like sugar and spice,\nno, like two peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.18,1:04:44.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.51,1:04:45.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.85,1:04:49.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The best team in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.92,1:04:52.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The best team in the universe!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.03,1:04:58.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.40,1:05:02.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,since you came to our school...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.50,1:05:07.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,April, May, June, July,\NAugust, September.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.77,1:05:10.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's been six months.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.14,1:05:12.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.84,1:05:14.68,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's been so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.18,1:05:19.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Time flies like an arrow.\NOr time is money,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.28,1:05:21.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,life is short...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.92,1:05:27.95,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.09,1:05:30.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What I want to say...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.47,1:05:37.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.57,1:05:47.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I... feel about you...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.70,1:06:13.13,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What is this shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.31,1:06:25.01,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Because... mine's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.55,1:09:15.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Since I was a kid,\NI always wondered...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.56,1:09:23.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why do people draw pictures?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:27.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Because we want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.33,1:09:31.73,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Because we have to draw.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:36.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.11,1:09:40.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,like asking people why they live.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.62,1:09:48.21,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Quite an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.12,1:09:53.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Straight as an arrow, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.19,1:09:59.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I genuinely envy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.43,1:10:06.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think, from the first time
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.60,1:10:10.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I saw your painting...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.91,1:10:46.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hear, hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.68,1:10:51.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You thought yesterday was\nrock bottom... Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.51,1:10:53.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Say whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.28,1:10:56.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You can't wait to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.02,1:11:00.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Winning or losing,\nthat's not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.09,1:11:05.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't even step into the ring,\njust toss in the towel.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.36,1:11:08.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It sure is safer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.57,1:11:17.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're up against a tough rival.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.81,1:11:23.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I have to agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:43.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How's Hagu doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.70,1:11:49.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't seen her recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.54,1:11:51.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.91,1:11:55.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is,\NHagu stopped painting.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.25,1:12:00.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Put simply, she's in a slump...\NSomething happen at the beach?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.25,1:12:04.05,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Gee, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.65,1:12:06.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Anything between\NHagu and Morita?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.46,1:12:10.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you suspect\NHagu-chan and Morita-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.60,1:12:15.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If anybody's going to get to Hagu,\nit's Morita, is what I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.63,1:12:19.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Not me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.30,1:12:22.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'd be happy if it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.47,1:12:25.77,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.81,1:12:30.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look at me like that,\nyour misery's contagious.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.65,1:12:35.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Drop in on her\nonce in a while, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.04,1:13:01.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu-chan, did you eat lunch?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.68,1:13:07.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.99,1:13:11.21,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.49,1:13:16.12,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,seem to manage "like always".
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.93,1:13:20.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're not well.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.67,1:13:33.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Hagu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.28,1:13:39.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything I can do...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.12,1:13:42.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy to...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.85,1:14:19.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, part-timer!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.62,1:14:21.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.66,1:14:22.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.63,1:14:32.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Render this as a drawing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.60,1:14:35.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I want it done today, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.84,1:14:37.03,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.07,1:15:05.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Takemoto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.37,1:15:14.87,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Life is so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.08,1:15:19.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Getting right to the heavy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.95,1:15:21.28,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How's things?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.92,1:15:24.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on a losing streak.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.02,1:15:28.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.86,1:15:32.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.53,1:15:38.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's time to look\nfor a four-leaf clover.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.44,1:15:43.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'd look for it,\nif it really exists.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.14,1:15:51.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you've never\nfound a four-leaf clover.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.08,1:15:58.58,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What? I thought they were\nfairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.72,1:16:01.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Like dragons and mermaids\nand Bigfoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.63,1:16:08.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You've led a life so unlucky\nit's almost genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.96,1:16:12.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that so intently.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.17,1:16:17.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.44,1:16:23.02,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone! We're all looking\nfor four-leaf clovers.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.31,1:16:25.71,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,For this miserable young man!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.62,1:16:32.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Can't find any.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.85,1:16:34.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Can't find any but it's still fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.46,1:16:36.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's fun to move around.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.36,1:16:40.95,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, I'm not having much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.43,1:16:45.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I guess sulking\ndoesn't suit me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.04,1:16:54.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Say.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.78,1:16:59.68,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Is my spine crooked?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.89,1:17:07.48,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.91,1:17:21.49,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b0\fsp2\bord0\shad0\fs26\pos(510,320)\frz5.724\c&H122051&}Sold
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.78,1:17:37.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Rice omelet?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.29,1:17:40.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.36,1:17:42.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.79,1:17:43.68,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Morita.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.15,1:18:09.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.73,1:18:20.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.63,1:18:25.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.94,1:18:30.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.44,1:18:34.97,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It won't shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.41,1:18:42.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, look at the time.\NSorry, see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.16,1:18:48.28,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.49,1:18:49.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.66,1:18:54.75,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.29,1:19:24.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I never run into you,\neven in the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.66,1:19:27.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm busy, in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.17,1:19:32.26,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows where Mayama is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.40,1:19:36.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,He's around.\NOnly, you never see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.98,1:19:42.97,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't seen Yamada\nsince the beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.81,1:19:47.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada-san's doing her best.\NYou just don't know about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.89,1:19:54.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, so everybody's doing\ntheir best without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.56,1:19:57.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds a little...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.00,1:20:02.86,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What about her?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.87,1:20:05.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.20,1:20:12.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me\nyou haven't seen Hagu-chan, either?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.64,1:20:17.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.65,1:20:24.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,In a word,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.96,1:20:28.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu-chan's in a slump.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.32,1:20:30.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,A slump?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.23,1:20:33.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Some kind of psychological shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.50,1:20:41.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.57,1:20:43.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You know perfectly well.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.64,1:20:50.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How much of a slump?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.21,1:20:53.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Worried?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.72,1:20:59.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.39,1:21:01.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.53,1:21:43.19,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll start out like an intern.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.33,1:21:46.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm barging in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.91,1:21:56.21,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And if I'm useful,\nplease let me work here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.35,1:21:58.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.68,1:22:03.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me work here for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.32,1:22:06.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It'll end the same way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.69,1:22:09.09,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.22,1:22:11.52,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if you hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.37,1:22:19.25,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I won't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.88,1:22:38.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't give up, Mayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.33,1:22:55.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.33,1:23:29.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to avoid abstracts\nthis time, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.11,1:23:34.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you take my advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.84,1:23:37.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,If you just listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.75,1:23:42.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,the Oslo International's\nwithin your reach.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.09,1:23:47.63,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But if you do what you
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.09,1:23:51.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,always do, you'll never\nbe competitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.73,1:23:55.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I know Hanamoto-sensei\nis well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.73,1:24:00.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I've seen so many\ntalented artists disappear
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.84,1:24:04.77,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,through recklessness and\nwillfulness.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.11,1:24:09.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Our job as instructors
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.51,1:24:12.64,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,should be to minimize\nsuch tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.02,1:24:16.95,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, she'll be crushed,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.32,1:24:19.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,by the weight of her own talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.99,1:24:24.76,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, that's definitely\nwhat will happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.86,1:24:32.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I think\nyou already know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.70,1:24:36.40,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Hanamoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.12,1:24:48.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't chase her, Morita!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.12,1:24:53.42,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mess with her heart\non a whim.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.56,1:24:54.49,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.70,1:25:05.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're absolutely right about\nthe role of instructors,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.67,1:25:10.17,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,but once in a while\nlet them dream for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.81,1:25:13.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.88,1:25:23.04,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.99,1:25:29.69,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.37,1:25:43.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That Hagu, not eating...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.24,1:25:45.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.61,1:25:49.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.91,1:25:54.28,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I guess Koda-sensei's prediction\ncame true.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.80,1:25:58.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I was hoping she could push\nthrough on sheer talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.99,1:26:05.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,She's got to crawl out\nof this on her own.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.26,1:26:06.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.90,1:26:11.30,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,All we can do is watch and wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.96,1:27:12.38,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And I....{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.09,1:27:16.22,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}was taken aback by\nhow very llttle,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.83,1:27:19.13,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I could actually do for her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.96,1:27:49.52,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meet Morita Shinobu-san.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.63,1:27:53.79,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Today's the opening\nof his solo show...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.77,1:28:00.38,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How's this flyer\nfor our next Hanamoto party?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.48,1:28:05.78,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look, that's Morita.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.22,1:28:13.52,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Morita-san, Morita-san!\NWhat on earth is this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.06,1:28:17.58,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Wait a minute!\NFive million yen!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.73,1:28:19.69,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Does this price include taxes?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.96,1:28:22.59,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Taxes? You tell her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.73,1:28:24.74,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No, it's tax-excluslve.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.60,1:28:27.23,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Tax-exclusive...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.28,1:28:30.67,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Do you have a girlfriend?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.41,1:28:34.17,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That question's so TV.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.31,1:28:35.90,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shall we recruit one?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.74,1:28:41.88,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder\nwhat's going to happen to us...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.22,1:28:45.48,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh! A commercial!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.29,1:28:48.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't be\non TV now, Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.26,1:29:29.43,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What I can do for her...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.00,1:29:39.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So, that was our\N"Hunk Hunter" section.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.61,1:29:43.37,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, this exhibition\nis open all week.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.25,1:29:50.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.29,1:29:52.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.12,1:29:54.95,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.09,1:30:12.01,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Takemoto.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.57,1:30:14.30,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Morita-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.58,1:30:18.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I was just being\nhunted by a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.55,1:30:20.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, but what are you\ndoing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.85,1:30:24.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know how bad Hagu-chan is?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.25,1:30:26.28,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.75,1:30:30.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Then why don't you do something?\NInstead of going on TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.73,1:30:37.82,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The person who can help Hagu now\nisn't Hanamoto-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.23,1:30:42.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,And it isn't me,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.24,1:30:45.07,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,it's you...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.87,1:30:47.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.91,1:30:53.10,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing I can do, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.48,1:30:56.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,There has to be something,\nif you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.02,1:30:59.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't think of anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.86,1:31:03.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,but I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.37,1:31:22.00,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Please look out for Hagu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.71,1:31:28.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Not that I'm\nin a position to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.96,1:31:44.16,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That was all I could do\nfor her, then.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.56,1:32:18.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Not so bad for being young.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.68,1:32:34.74,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And then I ran away,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.42,1:32:37.94,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}turning my back on\nmy entire past,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.79,1:32:40.98,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}as though tumbling down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.96,1:33:16.32,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.37,1:33:21.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's party...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.90,1:33:26.87,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.84,1:34:45.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.18,1:34:51.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's a {\i1}kashira{\i0} rail, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.69,1:34:55.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Dates from the 15th century?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.59,1:35:00.09,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.80,1:35:03.23,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Want to try?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.20,1:35:05.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I can?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.77,1:35:10.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.44,1:35:15.53,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're a pest, go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.48,1:35:20.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.97,1:35:48.31,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Before I realized,\NI was racing,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.44,1:35:51.97,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}intent only on pedaling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.21,1:35:55.01,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.95,1:36:01.92,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was remembering,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.92,1:36:05.69,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Morita-san's irritating\nloud laugh,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.23,1:36:09.99,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yamada-san's face,\ntrying not to cry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.83,1:36:14.67,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Mayama-san's\nsurprisingly sweet voice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.92,1:36:20.34,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Your smile.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.14,1:36:56.88,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll scream, Takemoto.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.88,1:36:59.51,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds good, Morita-san.\NYou're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.98,1:37:04.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the best!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.25,1:37:08.62,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Youth is best!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.59,1:37:15.90,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,When you say the word youth,\nit's so totally earnest.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.67,1:37:30.67,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Where had the sparkling sea gone?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.81,1:37:34.33,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can't run away.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.28,1:37:41.41,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I run now,\nit erases everything,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.16,1:37:45.35,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}even meeting you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.15,1:38:07.48,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.07,1:38:35.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the vibe in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.81,1:38:40.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Amidst a certain sadness,\nlet's start the Hanamoto party.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.52,1:38:43.94,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Does everyone have\nsomething to drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.95,1:38:48.48,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,A toast to Hanamoto-sensei's\nscraggly beard.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.62,1:38:50.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.93,1:39:00.42,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No, no, that's not what I meant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.57,1:39:03.67,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So, which did you take first...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.87,1:39:06.36,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You seem a little strange today.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.84,1:39:09.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.94,1:39:11.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're not strange...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.21,1:39:15.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Morita-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.67,1:40:14.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama I'm borrowing\nyour car.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.69,1:40:27.09,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You don't mind, the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.19,1:40:31.92,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.06,1:40:35.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.93,1:40:38.60,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mind your own business,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.10,1:40:41.89,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,and do something about\nthat giant pickle.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.81,1:40:50.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Watching you...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.25,1:40:56.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,was like watching myself.\NIt was painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.16,1:41:05.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But eventually, being uncool,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.43,1:41:09.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,or being stubborn
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.43,1:41:14.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,didn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.64,1:41:22.44,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.69,1:43:14.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.06,1:43:26.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I still can't give up on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.17,1:43:36.34,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you drooled.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.25,1:43:48.65,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.56,1:43:52.75,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.71,1:44:12.18,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Mayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.62,1:44:16.81,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I really like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.12,1:44:20.21,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.56,1:44:23.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.09,1:44:27.29,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.36,1:44:29.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.94,1:44:40.91,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So this is how it feels
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.64,1:44:44.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,to burn your own work.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.81,1:44:49.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.69,1:44:54.61,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Like burning stacks of cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.36,1:45:03.66,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, it's only\nmoney burning here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.63,1:45:05.93,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Stacks of cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.97,1:45:08.43,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,But not my work.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.74,1:45:11.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,At some point,\nit stopped being my art.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.68,1:45:20.96,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Can I say something\nmore embarrassing?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.85,1:45:25.55,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.12,1:45:28.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You've got Hanamoto-san,\nyou've got me,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.76,1:45:30.72,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,you've got Yamada\nand Mayama.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.29,1:45:35.13,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Takemoto's worried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.40,1:45:45.03,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,So don't go off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.21,1:45:54.41,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,The reason I'm talking\nlike a teenager...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.58,1:45:57.24,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's his fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.58,1:45:59.31,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's Takemoto's fault.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.55,1:46:03.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Mr. Youth told me\nto think it over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.96,1:46:06.59,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That I should be able to help you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.50,1:46:14.16,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Your ass is bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.40,1:46:17.70,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Just joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.54,1:46:25.14,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Want a ride?\NThere's room for your bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.91,1:46:28.28,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.78,1:46:30.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.92,1:46:33.15,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.59,1:46:35.45,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You're searching for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.86,1:46:37.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.13,1:46:40.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.76,1:46:42.39,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.27,1:46:47.56,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,It's great to be young.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.87,1:46:55.35,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.81,1:47:00.84,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Take this and go find yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.65,1:47:07.95,hc_fo,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\3c&H635514&}Sawada Construction\N{\be1\3c&H000000&}Tel: 075-717-12XX
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.16,1:47:12.99,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.17,1:47:26.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It never occurs to me\nto help someone, seriously.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.64,1:47:29.54,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.18,1:47:33.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't figure it out,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.98,1:47:35.74,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,and here I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.85,1:47:42.98,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Am I helping you?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.13,1:47:52.33,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.47,1:48:00.80,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.35,1:48:10.11,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.49,1:48:14.85,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Save your thanks for Mr. Youth.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.16,1:48:20.79,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.20,1:48:25.22,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I thought you'd do.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.97,1:48:35.60,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Someday I want to support you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.03,1:48:40.01,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I want to have the strength\nto support you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.21,1:48:44.98,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But for now, I'll do what I can.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.79,1:48:50.19,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Right now, I'll tell you\nwhat I need to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.01,1:49:42.27,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hagu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.35,1:49:46.47,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.92,1:49:54.08,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Love you, Hagu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.07,1:50:06.50,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.41,1:50:18.21,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}How's your work, Takemoto-kun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.81,1:50:20.51,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Is it too hard?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.32,1:50:26.51,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Morita-san had his first\nsolo show in New York.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.89,1:50:31.72,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The reviews were not great.\NThey just make him more passionate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.26,1:50:37.16,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Mayama was officially hired\nat Harada Design.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.46,1:50:40.46,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In love and in work,\nhe's hustling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.70,1:50:42.46,hc_standard,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,Hustling?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.90,1:50:46.13,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Frankly, he can do\nwhatever he wants.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.31,1:50:52.30,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Me... I'm laying low for now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.88,1:50:57.94,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh, right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.95,1:51:01.72,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hagu-chan finished a new painting{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.85,1:51:07.31,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}with that brush\nyou repaired for her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.93,1:51:12.02,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's cobalt blue,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.87,1:51:14.40,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}a shimmering, beautiful,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.10,1:51:17.90,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}painting of the sea...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.34,1:51:20.74,hc_alternative,Comment,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I think.{\i0}
